# The Aletheia frontend packages (@rennnyyy/aletheia-tokens|core|ui|shell) come
# from GitHub Packages, not npmjs. Only the scope mapping lives here — the token
# never does: a developer's user-level ~/.npmrc provides it locally, and CI/Docker
# writes it via `npm config set //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken` (see deploy.yml
# NPM_TOKEN and the Dockerfile build stage).
@rennnyyy:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
